rdiovascular support: 30°300mg (1°10 soft capsules) of Coenzyme Q10 per day. Prophylaxis of migraine: 150°300mg (5°10 soft capsules) of Coenzyme Q10 per day. Use the medication for at least 3 months to observe its full therapeutic efficacy."}, "detailedIngredients": {"excipients": "Soybean oil, lecithin, palm oil, partially hydrogenated soybean oil, white beeswax, gelatin, concentrated glycerin, D-sorbitol 70%, ethyl vanillin, Sunset Yellow FCF, Allura Red AC, titanium dioxide, purified water.", "activeIngredients": "Ubidecarenon (Coenzyme Q10) 30mg"}, "specialPatientGroups": {"lactation": "It is unknown whether Coenzyme Q10 is excreted in human breast milk. Use only when clearly necessary.", "pregnancy": "Animal studies do not indicate direct or indirect harmful effects with respect to pregnancy. No clinical studies have been conducted on pregnant women regarding teratogenic effects when using Coenzyme Q10. The medication should only be used during the first trimester of pregnancy if the potential benefit outweighs the potential risk."}, "warningsAndPrecautions": ["Use with caution in patients with bile duct obstruction and hepatic impairment due to the potential accumulation of Coenzyme Q10.", "There have been reports that Coenzyme Q10 decreases the anticoagulant efficacy of warfarin. Patients taking warfarin should be monitored regarding this effect.", "Coenzyme Q10 and cholesterol share the same biosynthetic pathway; lovastatin, simvastatin, and pravastatin are known to lower endogenous Coenzyme Q10 levels. Other statin medications may share this effect.", "TICONET contains soybean oil. If allergic to peanut or soybean, do not use this medication.", "TICONET contains sorbitol. Patients with rare hereditary problems of fructose intolerance should not use this medication.", "TICONET contains Sunset Yellow FCF, which may cause allergic reactions."]}	f	ACTIVE	2026-04-08 21:52:30.413	ticonet-30mg-soft-capsules-for-cardiovascular-health-support-10-blisters-x-10-soft-capsules	165
