maceutical Vietnam Co., Ltd. (Vietnam)"}, "usageInstructions": {"dosage": "Adults and children over 2 years of age: Apply medication to the affected area no more than 3 to 4 times daily.,Children under 2 years of age: Consult a physician prior to use.,Note: The dosage recommendations above are for reference only. The specific dosage depends on individual physiological status and the severity of the condition.", "missedDose": "If a dose of medication is missed, apply it as soon as you remember. However, if it is almost time for your next dose, skip the missed dose and resume your regular dosing schedule. Do not double the dose.", "administration": "Salonpas Gel is for topical application to the skin only.", "overdoseManagement": "Abnormal symptoms such as nausea or vomiting may occur if ingested. In the event of applying a large amount and experiencing adverse reactions, discontinue use, wash the application area thoroughly with clean water, and consult a physician or pharmacist."}, "generalDescription": "Salonpas Gel is a topical analgesic and nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory drug (NSAID). It contains active pharmaceutical ingredients such as methyl salicylate and menthol, providing rapid and sustained pain relief.", "detailedIngredients": {"excipients": "Carboxy vinyl polymer, Polyoxyethylene oleylamine, Hydroxypropyl cellulose, Propylene glycol, Perfume, Ethanol.", "activeIngredients": "Methyl Salicylate 15%, l-Menthol 7%"}, "specialPatientGroups": {"lactation": "Consult a physician prior to use while breastfeeding.", "pediatric": "Children under 2 years of age: Consult a physician prior to use.", "pregnancy": "Consult a physician prior to use during pregnancy."}, "warningsAndPrecautions": ["Use strictly according to directions and prescribed dosages.", "For external use only. Do not swallow or ingest.", "Do not use concurrently with heating pads. Do not bandage tightly.", "If symptoms persist after several days of use, clear up and recur within a few days, discontinue use and consult a physician."]}	f	ACTIVE	2026-04-08 21:46:02.685	salonpas-pain-relief-gel-methyl-salicylate-15percent-and-l-menthol-7percent-topical-analgesic-30g	255
