ysician or pharmacist.", "Young children may be at risk of choking on solid lozenges; exercise strict caution and adult supervision when administering to pediatric patients."], "adverseReactionManagement": "If any hypersensitivity reactions, severe oral irritation, or persistent gastrointestinal adverse effects occur, discontinue use immediately and seek medical evaluation or visit the nearest healthcare facility for appropriate supportive management."}	f	ACTIVE	2026-04-08 21:15:33.659	strepsils-cool-2-4-dichlorobenzyl-alcohol-1-2-mg-amylmetacresol-0-6-mg-antiseptic-and-cooling	257
