1591	Sartanpo 50mg OPV Tablets for Hypertension (Box of 3 Blisters x 10 Tablets)	P29108	\N	\N	\N	Vietnam	181111.00	163000.00	https://prod-cdn.pharmacity.io/e-com/images/ecommerce/20250715044441-0-P29108.jpg?versionId=67g9rkwAnncatXLTd9M7lNMm4nfNQNcJ	Sartanpo 50mg OPV is indicated for the treatment of hypertension, available in a box of 3 blisters containing 10 tablets each.	{"indications": ["For the treatment of hypertension. May be used alone or in combination with other antihypertensive medications."], "contraindications": ["Contraindicated in hypersensitivity to any component of the product, elderly patients and children under 12 years of age, pregnancy, and lactation."], "manufacturingInfo": {"storage": "Keep out of reach of children. Store in a dry, cool place, protected from direct sunlight."}, "usageInstructions": {"dosage": "Dosage must be individualized. The usual starting dose is 50 mg once daily. A starting dose of 25 mg once daily is recommended for patients with intravascular volume depletion (e.g., patients treated with high-dose diuretics) and patients with a history of hepatic impairment. The maximal antihypertensive effect of losartan is attained 3 to 6 weeks after initiation of therapy.", "administration": "Administered orally. May be taken with or without food."}, "detailedIngredients": {"activeIngredients": "Losartan 50mg, Rosuvastatin 50mg"}}	t	ACTIVE	2026-04-08 21:44:27.699	sartanpo-50mg-opv-tablets-for-hypertension-box-of-3-blisters-x-10-tablets	\N
