he.", "pregnancy": "Should not be administered during pregnancy as there is no clinical indication for treating endometriosis during gestation."}, "warningsAndPrecautions": ["Pregnancy must be formally excluded prior to the initiation of treatment.", "Hormonal contraception must be discontinued before starting treatment with this medicinal product.", "A careful benefit-risk assessment should be performed in patients with a history of ectopic pregnancy or impairment of fallopian tube function.", "A risk-benefit analysis should be evaluated if any risk factors for clinical deterioration or aggravation of underlying conditions are present."], "adverseReactionManagement": "If adverse reactions occur, patients should consult their treating physician or seek immediate medical attention for appropriate clinical management."}	t	ACTIVE	2026-04-08 21:26:54.11	visanne-2mg-dienogest-tablets-for-the-treatment-of-endometriosis-2-blisters-x-14-tablets	\N
