ered, then resume taking one tablet weekly on the originally selected day. Do not take two tablets on the same day.", "administration": "The medication should be taken on the same day of each week.,Do not take the medication with food, beverages other than plain water, or other medications.,Take one tablet at least 30 minutes before the first food, beverage, or other medication of the day.,Swallow the tablet whole; do not suck or chew it.,Take while in an upright position with a full glass of plain water (>120 mL).,Patients should not lie down for 30 minutes after taking the medication.,Calcium and vitamin D supplementation should be considered if dietary intake is inadequate.", "overdoseManagement": "Decreases in serum calcium may occur following substantial overdose.,Milk or antacids containing magnesium, calcium, or aluminum may be administered to reduce absorption.,In cases of severe overdose, gastric lavage may be considered."}, "generalDescription": "Sancefur 35mg contains the active ingredient risedronate sodium, which is used for the treatment and prevention of osteoporosis.", "detailedIngredients": {"activeIngredients": "Risedronate sodium 35mg"}, "specialPatientGroups": {"geriatric": "No dosage adjustment is required.", "pediatric": "Safety and efficacy have not been established in children and adolescents."}}	t	ACTIVE	2026-04-08 21:40:18.777	sancefur-35mg-risedronate-sodium-tablets-for-treatment-and-prevention-of-osteoporosis-box-of-1	350
