"brand": "Viatris (Pfizer UpJohn)", "origin": "France", "storage": "Store below 30°C.", "packaging": "Box of 1 blister pack x 4 film-coated tablets.", "manufacturer": "Zone Industrielle, 29 route des Industries 37530, Poce sur Cisse, France"}, "usageInstructions": {"dosage": "Adults: The recommended dose is 50 mg taken as needed, which can be increased to a maximum of 100 mg or decreased to 25 mg based on tolerability. Maximum frequency is once daily. Pediatric population: Not indicated for individuals under 18 years of age. Elderly: No dosage adjustment required. Mild/moderate renal impairment: No dosage adjustment required. Severe renal impairment: 25 mg. Hepatic impairment: 25 mg.", "missedDose": "Take as soon as remembered. If it is almost time for the next dose, skip the missed dose. Do not take a double dose.", "administration": "For oral administration, taken approximately one hour prior to sexual activity.", "overdoseManagement": "Adverse reactions at high doses (800 mg/dose/day) were similar to those at lower doses but with increased frequency and severity. Appropriate supportive measures should be instituted. Renal dialysis does not accelerate clearance."}, "generalDescription": "Viagra 100 mg, manufactured by Pfizer Australia, contains sildenafil citrate as its active ingredient. It is a medication indicated for the treatment of erectile dysfunction in adult males. The medication is formulated as blue, diamond-shaped, film-coated tablets and is typically administered approximately one hour prior to sexual activity.", "detailedIngredients": {"excipients": "Microcrystalline cellulose, anhydrous dibasic calcium phosphate, croscarmellose sodium, magnesium stearate, Opadry blue OY-LS-20921 (containing hypromellose, lactose monohydrate, titanium dioxide, triacetin, FD&C Blue #2 / Indigo Carmine aluminum lake E132), Opadry Clear YS-2-19114-A (containing hypromellose, triacetin), purified water", "activeIngredients": "100 mg sildenafil (as sildenafil citrate)"}, "specialPatientGroups": {"geriatric": "No dosage adjustment required.", "lactation": "Contraindicated.", "pediatric": "Not indicated for individuals under 18 years of age.", "pregnancy": "Contraindicated."}, "warningsAndPrecautions": ["Evaluate cardiovascular status prior to initiating treatment.", "Not recommended for men advised against sexual activity.", "Use with caution in patients with left ventricular outflow obstruction (e.g., aortic stenosis, hypertrophic obstructive cardiomyopathy) or systemic atrophy syndromes.", "Use with caution in patients with a history of cardiovascular risk factors, retinitis pigmentosa, bleeding disorders, active peptic ulceration, anatomical deformation of the penis, or conditions predisposing to priapism."], "adverseReactionManagement": "Discontinue use and inform a physician or report to the nearest medical facility for prompt management."}	t	ACTIVE	2026-04-08 21:49:31.693	viagra-100mg-sildenafil-citrate-film-coated-tablets-for-erectile-dysfunction-box-of-1-blister-pack	376
