y due to potential teratogenic or abortifacient effects."}, "warningsAndPrecautions": ["Griseofulvin has the potential to cause severe toxicity.", "During prolonged treatment, periodic monitoring of renal, hepatic, and hematopoietic functions is required. Discontinue the medication if leukopenia or neutropenia develops.", "Avoid sun exposure as the medication causes photosensitivity reactions, which may exacerbate systemic lupus erythematosus.", "Potential cross-allergenicity with penicillins."], "adverseReactionManagement": "Inform your physician promptly of any adverse reactions experienced during the use of the medication."}	t	ACTIVE	2026-04-08 21:52:03.192	griseofulvin-500mg-vidipha-tablets-for-treatment-of-dermatophytosis-of-the-skin-hair-and-nails-2	1
