cyclines", "effect": "Increases intracranial pressure (pseudotumor cerebri)."}, {"drug": "Low-dose progestogen", "effect": "Decreases the efficacy of contraceptive medications."}, {"drug": "Phenytoin", "effect": "May decrease the therapeutic efficacy of the medication."}, {"drug": "Ketoconazole", "effect": "Increases serum concentrations of corticosteroids."}], "effectsOnDriving": "Exercise caution when driving or operating machinery if visual disturbances such as blurred vision, somnolence, or photophobia occur.", "contraindications": ["Patients with hepatic impairment or renal impairment.", "Patients with hypervitaminosis A.", "Patients with hyperlipidemia.", "Patients with hypersensitivity to Isotretinoin or any component of the medication.", "Concurrent administration with tetracycline antibiotics.", "Pregnant women, women planning to become pregnancy, and nursing mothers.", "Patients currently using or who have used Isotretinoin within the preceding month must not donate blood for transfusion to women of childbearing potential."], "manufacturingInfo": {"brand": "MEGA", "origin": "Thailand", "storage": "Store in a dry place, below 30°C. Protect from direct sunlight.", "packaging": "Box of 3 blisters x 10 capsules", "manufacturer": "MEGA Lifesciences Ltd"}, "usageInstructions": {"dosage": "Adults and adolescents: 0.5 - 1 mg/kg body weight daily (divided into two doses, taken with meals) for 15 - 20 weeks. Maximum dose: 2 mg/kg/day for very severe cases. Maintenance dose: 0.1 - 1 mg/kg/day depending on individual response.", "administration": "Administer with food. Not recommended for children under 12 years of age."}, "detailedIngredients": {"excipients": "White beeswax, Butylated hydroxyanisole, Edetate disodium, Hydrogenated vegetable oil, Soybean oil. Capsule shell: Gelatin, Glycerin, Sorbitol solution 76%, Carmoisine (E122), FD&C Blue No.1, Ponceau 4R (E124), Black iron oxide (E172), Titanium dioxide (E171), Purified water.", "activeIngredients": "Isotretinoi